                                "de": "Herbsttage sind oft kalt, windig und <w>hässlich</w>.",
                                "en": "Autumn days are often cold, windy, and <w>gloomy</w>.",
                                "zh": "秋天常常是寒冷、多风且天色<w>阴沉</w>的。"
                            }
